{"id":"ecaf0182-19f0-4d57-be00-c24c692ebffb","title":"Retro Gridscape 2","slug":"retro-gridscape-2","collectionSlug":"retro-gridscape","collectionName":"Retro Gridscape","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A 3D perspective grid shader effect rendered in bright neon green against a very dark background. The grid consists of 13x13 cells with bright lime-green lines (#008a30) creating a receding checkerboard pattern that extends toward the horizon. The perspective is tilted at approximately 73 degrees, creating a dramatic vanishing point effect where the grid lines converge toward the center-upper portion of the image. The grid lines have a thickness of 3.2 units and appear to glow intensely with a bloom/glow effect (intensity 22.5, size 14) that creates a luminous halo around each line, enhancing the neon aesthetic. A vignette effect with high intensity (0.79) darkens the edges significantly, creating a tunnel-like focus toward the center. The background is a very dark forest green (#003304), almost black. A subtle VHS distortion effect (wobble 0.74, smear -0.06, scanline noise 0.11) adds analog video artifacts and slight chromatic aberration. A linear gradient mask fades the upper portion of the grid, creating depth perception. The overall mood is cyberpunk/retro-futuristic with a strong sense of motion and digital space. The glow effect creates a soft luminescence that bleeds slightly beyond the grid lines, enhancing the neon quality.","colors":["#008a30","#003304","#1aff00","#000000"],"labels":["geometric","glowing","3d","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/ecaf0182-19f0-4d57-be00-c24c692ebffb.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"LinearGradient","id":"idmsq7hg3vjcs9ha3lt","_key":"key_msq7hg3vjcs9ha3lt","props":{"end":{"x":0.5,"y":0.3728956228956229},"angle":0,"edges":"stretch","start":{"x":0.5,"y":0.75},"stops":[{"color":"#ffffff","position":0},{"color":"#ffffff00","position":1}],"colorA":"#1aff00","colorB":"#0000ff","opacity":1,"visi